  "keyFeatures": [
    "28 ready-to-use WebGL shaders including gradients, noise patterns, and image filters",
    "Zero runtime dependencies — pure WebGL2 canvas rendering",
    "React component wrappers with full TypeScript support",
    "Animated with controllable speed, frame offset, and direction",
    "Highly customizable via typed props (colors, distortion, scale, fit, rotation, etc.)",
    "Automatic canvas resizing with configurable pixel ratio and max pixel count",
    "Image filter shaders (fluted glass, water, dithering, heatmap, liquid metal, halftone)",
    "Server-side rendering (SSR) safe with undefined uniform handling",
    "Designed in Paper — export directly to code"
  ],
